&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Journalist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weekly office requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid, 2 days in office &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At GWI we’re always looking for extraordinary people who thrive on making an extraordinary impact. Right now we’re looking for a Senior Data Journalist to play a key role in our PR &amp;amp; Comms team in London. If that’s you, and making a difference gets you out of bed in the morning, keep reading. It could be the start of something, well, extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;As our Senior Data Journalist, you’ll:
&lt;p&gt;Play a pivotal role within the PR &amp;amp; Corporate Comms team, interrogating GWI data and transforming it into actionable, commercially impactful and, editorially punchy narratives. With a journalistic mindset, your work will showcase the value of GWI’s solutions across key personas, verticals and, companies to support GWI’s positioning at the forefront of AI-powered insights in an increasingly agent-driven world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things you’ll be responsible for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support proactive pitches and media enquiries with data points to strengthen the story and build trust with media partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Marketing and PR team to deliver narrative and unique view points for events through relevant formats and channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with Head of Comms, lead on the development and upkeep of industry wide data story tracking and wider press narrative trends, themes and forward features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, GWI leaders and Insights team to identify strategic thought-leadership themes and bring them to life through compelling data stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Marketing team to support ABM and demand gen efforts for high-value prospects by transforming GWI data into bespoke insights that drive engagement and accelerate pipeline through tailored content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build bespoke data stories for high-value accounts, enabling Marketing and Revenue teams to deliver personalized campaigns and outreach that resonate with target prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver outputs including presentations, white papers, reports, podcasts, interviews, op-eds and joint deliverables with clients or partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all thought leadership demonstrates ROI for target audiences by connecting directly to their workflows and jobs-to-be-done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent GWI on global stages—at conferences, client events, panels, and round tables—as a confident and credible spokesperson.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an ambassador within GWI and occasionally as a spokesperson for press, championing the narratives we take to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;It’s also fun; shaking things up is what working for GWI is all about. You’ll need to be flexible, comfortable with continuous change, and working in a high-tempo environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What do I need to bring with me?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll need to be able to demonstrate the core skills this role requires. You don&#39;t have to tick all the boxes right away; the important thing is that you’re willing to learn. Here’s what the team will be looking for in you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert analysis and storytelling skills, with the ability to turn data into insights that directly address media enquiries and client challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability to engage diverse audiences—from research specialists to commercial leaders—always bringing the room with you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in PR strategy and media/journalist relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and writing skills, with the confidence to deliver hour-long sessions,co-present, and field challenging questions on the spot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with quantitative research methods and mastery of GWI’s data and software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of GWI’s competitive landscape and future as the human intelligence for the AI era.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work independently, managing the end-to-end process of thought leadership creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equally important is attitude. We want people who think big (to make an impact), ask why (to find a better way), and show respect (to everyone, at every level, all the time). Those are our values, and they’re a big part of what we’re looking for in you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence the global narrative of a fast-scaling company with ambitions to define an emerging category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside senior executives and cross-functional leaders where your impact is visible at the highest levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a fast-paced, growth-oriented culture with opportunities to make your mark and grow your career as the company scales globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion 🫶&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity is fundamental to who we are—as a data company and as a workplace. Our data reflects global realities, and so must our teams. We strive to build a workforce as diverse and inclusive as the insights we deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Disability Confident employer, we welcome applications from disabled candidates and are committed to making adjustments throughout the hiring process—whether that&#39;s extra time, materials in advance or a different format, breaks, an adjusted interview format, assistive tools, or flexible scheduling. We&#39;re happy to discuss whatever would work best for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We actively encourage applications from underrepresented and marginalised communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI, you&#39;ll find a place to contribute meaningfully, grow professionally, and belong fully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
