&lt;h1&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Machine Learning Engineer at Picnic, you will design and deploy intelligent systems to solve our company’s biggest challenges. Beyond building models, you will productionize them with strong monitoring and seamless integration into operational systems. You will collaborate closely with stakeholders to ensure the right problems are solved and that solutions deliver real-world impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;All using high quality data. Our data is registered, logged, and consistent, enabling you to focus on building and improving models rather than cleaning data. This role combines the skills of a consultant, software engineer, and applied mathematician.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will definitely:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify and execute &lt;/strong&gt;improvement possibilities together with other ML Engineers and (product) analysts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt; on your project from inception to production, to continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop&lt;/strong&gt; tools and enhancements for our cloud-based Machine Learning platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You could work on various projects and fields, such as:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demand forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; delivery, article, trip volumes, used Picnic-wide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud detection:&lt;/strong&gt; helping us keep troublemakers out of our store&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommendation systems:&lt;/strong&gt; generating useful in-app grocery suggestions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Search and ranking:&lt;/strong&gt; helping our customers find exactly what they need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Predicting delivery drop-off times&lt;/strong&gt;: making sure we’re on-time at every customer’s door&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; ensuring quality control and smooth operations within our warehouses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out some of our previous machine learning projects here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.picnic.nl/tagged/machine-learning&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;https://blog.picnic.nl/tagged/machine-learning&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree or higher in AI, Computer Science, Mathematics, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in data science or applied machine learning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, you can clearly explain complex ideas in non-technical terms and enjoy working closely with business stakeholders to solve problems together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in designing, deploying, and maintaining production ML systems, with solid software engineering and ML principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and SQL skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to define the long-term vision and technical architecture for ML solutions within your domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker, Kubernetes, and CI is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾 Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗 Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚲 Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎 Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📆 All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join one of France’s fastest-growing foodtech scale-ups&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we’re transforming the way people cook and eat. Through our meal-kit boxes, we help thousands of customers cook delicious, balanced meals at home while reducing food waste and simplifying everyday life.&amp;nbsp;Operating in 15+ countries, HelloFresh is one of the world’s leading foodtech companies. The French market, launched in 2020, has experienced hyper growth and became market leader in 2021.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Behind this growth is a simple formula: technology, data, and a team of ambitious people working together to reinvent food at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;If you want to work at the intersection of data, strategy, and growth, and have a tangible impact on a fast-scaling business, this internship is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Growth Strategy Data Analyst Intern, you will join the Analytics &amp;amp; Performance team and work closely with the Growth Marketing team to help drive HelloFresh’s growth in France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a data partner to business stakeholders, turning complex data into actionable insights that influence key strategic decisions, marketing investment decisions, and customer lifecycle optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will directly impact critical growth levers such as customer acquisition, retention, pricing strategy, and website optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines business analysis, experimentation, and data modeling, giving you end-to-end exposure to how data drives decisions in a growing company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for candidates who want to apply rigorous analytics to real business problems and see their insights translated into concrete growth decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with modern analytics tools including SQL, Tableau, and Google Sheets, as well as internal data pipelines to analyze large-scale datasets and support data-driven decision-making across the Growth team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive business-impacting analyses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive analyses on key growth topics such as customer acquisition, retention, pricing strategy, discount optimization, and marketing channel performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve conversion, marketing efficiency, and customer lifetime value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into clear, actionable recommendations for business stakeholders&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Growth Marketing managers and team leads to support strategic decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and recommendations that influence budget allocation and growth strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support experimentation and A/B testing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design, monitoring, and analysis of A/B tests and growth experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the impact of new initiatives and help scale successful strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build data products and dashboards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track key business KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that enable the marketing team to make data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data models, reporting pipelines, and analysis frameworks that help teams scale their decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone curious, analytical, and eager to tackle complex business problems using data.&amp;nbsp;You are comfortable navigating large datasets, structuring ambiguous questions, and translating analyses into insights that drive business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking and ability to structure complex business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL, Excel / Google Sheets, and data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization tools (Tableau is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate data into clear and actionable business insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gap-year or final-year student from a top engineering or business school&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in data, consulting, strategy, or analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steep learning curve in one of Europe’s fastest-growing scale-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to real business decisions driven by data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounts on HelloFresh boxes, Swile meal vouchers, and Wellpass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offices in the heart of Paris (1st arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CV review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invitation to Case Study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interviews with your future managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your first days will include dedicated onboarding sessions with key managers across teams to help you understand HelloFresh’s organization and business model.&amp;nbsp;You’ll then quickly dive into your projects and start contributing to the team’s impact from day one.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Analyst Working Student at Picnic, you’ll be at the forefront of innovation, tackling complex challenges with fresh, groundbreaking solutions. This role is all about driving impact: you’ll analyze data, help identify opportunities, and support strategies that push boundaries and redefine the grocery shopping experience. You’ll join a dynamic and collaborative team in a fast-paced, innovative environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solving real-life puzzles: &lt;/strong&gt;Tackle critical business questions that shape Picnic’s business model every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling: &lt;/strong&gt;Achieve operational excellence by approaching challenges with a data-driven and analytical mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and optimize models for real-time improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicating: &lt;/strong&gt;Work effectively with different teams to deliver impactful and sustainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning your projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Take initiative by challenging the status. Just because it’s been done that way doesn’t mean it’s the best way. Try us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a &lt;strong&gt;Master’s&lt;/strong&gt; in a Quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for &lt;strong&gt;business consulting and data analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating&lt;strong&gt; complex analytical challenges&lt;/strong&gt; into clear strategies and executing business solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;SQL and Python&lt;/strong&gt; or excited to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in both verbal and written &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; and have an&lt;strong&gt; EU citizenship&lt;/strong&gt; available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;minimum 16h&lt;/strong&gt; per week for&lt;strong&gt; minimum 4 months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French speaker or good knowledge of the French market with a valid &lt;strong&gt;EU work permit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Depending on your performance, we can discuss further opportunities at Picnic!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will have the opportunity to develop your skills, not only through stimulating projects but also thanks to a dynamic, young, and international environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧑‍🎓&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎓&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎&lt;strong&gt;Health and Transportation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Through our partnerships with Malakoff Humanis and OpenUp, you have the opportunity to enroll in our company health insurance plan, as well as free and easy access to professional psychologists, workshops, and practical tools. Additionally, if you commute to work using public transportation, we reimburse 50% of your subscription cost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🥗&lt;strong&gt;Food&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Since we are located in the center of Paris, there is no on-site cafeteria. However, you will receive meal vouchers worth €11 per day to explore all the delicious restaurants nearby. Our small kitchen is also stocked with tasty snacks and refreshments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please submit your application in English or prepare an English CV.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
