&lt;li&gt;Peer interviews with several team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Executive Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Bar Raiser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Team Engagement Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires up to 10% travel for team collaboration, customer engagements, and company events. As part of our commitment to building strong connections across our fully distributed team, attendance at our annual company offsite (typically held in Mexico) is expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;108&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in Ireland is €95,000–€110,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in United Kingdom is £105,000–£115,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary for this role in Bulgaria is €6,500+ gross per month, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
